#: ../../functions/func_swapprefix.rst:6
msgid "$swapprefix"
msgstr ""

#: ../../functions/func_swapprefix.rst:8
msgid "Usage: **$swapprefix(text[,prefixes])**"
msgstr "用法：**$swapprefix(text[,prefixes])**"

#: ../../functions/func_swapprefix.rst:9
msgid "Category: text"
msgstr "类别：文本"

#: ../../functions/func_swapprefix.rst:10
msgid "Implemented: Picard 1.3 (*previously as a plugin since Picard 0.13*)"
msgstr "实现：Picard 1.3 (*之前作为插件，自 Picard 0.13*)"

#: ../../functions/func_swapprefix.rst:12
msgid "**Description:**"
msgstr "**描述：**"

#: ../../functions/func_swapprefix.rst:14
msgid "Moves the specified ``prefixes`` from the beginning to the end of ``text``. Any number of ``prefixes`` can be specified, separated by commas. If no prefix is specified \"A\" and \"The\" are used by default. Note that the matching is case-sensitive."
msgstr ""
"将指定的 ``prefixes`` 从 ``text`` 的开头移到末尾。可以指定任意数量的 "
"``prefixes``，用逗号分隔。如果没有指定前缀，默认使用 \"A\" 和 \"The\"。请注意"
"，匹配是区分大小写的。"

